      "content": "Those are good high-level pillars, but my students really need more depth to handle high-level competition. Could you expand on the \"national sovereignty\" point specifically? Like, what are the deeper philosophical arguments about why a state's right to exclude is central to its existence? And can you give me some specific, sophisticated ways to frame the \"rule of law\" argument so it doesn't just sound like they're repeating slogans?",
